ttom flow: decoder_stage(128, 64, 64); Concat: 128 \u00d7 128 \u00d7 192; Stage 7; 128 \u00d7 128 \u00d7 64; decoder_stage(64, 32, 32); Concat: 256 \u00d7 256 \u00d7 96; Stage 8; 256 \u00d7 256 \u00d7 32.\nIncoming bottom: Saved Stage 1; 128 \u00d7 128 \u00d7 64; Saved Stage 0; 256 \u00d7 256 \u00d7 32.\nSerif shape labels and bold monospace calls match the edit target. Polish materials and antialiasing only; no architecture, geometry, text or color-meaning changes.\n",
